        <item>
            <title>0.12.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 20:22:47 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.12.1</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.12.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.12.1</h2>
<ul>
<li>The Compass now opens the way it was designed: the app&#x27;s context menu is up, the app launcher left, window actions right, and the universal menu down. If you had never rearranged it, yours follows; a hand-arranged Compass keeps your order</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
